# 08 · Gbxra ohpxrg naq cre-pyvrag yvzvgf — jnyxguebhtu bs gur ersrerapr fbyhgvba

## Fgehpgher

Bar svyr, va sbhe ynlref, rnpu ohvyg ba gur bar orsber:

1. `pbasvt` naq `arjPbasvt`: gur inyvqngrq, vzzhgnoyr frggvatf gung Yvzvgre naq Xrlrq funer.
2. `ohpxrg`: gur gbxra nevguzrgvp. Ab ybpx, ab pybpx: gur pnyyre cnffrf gur gvzr va naq ubyqf
   jungrire ybpx cebgrpgf gur ohpxrg. Guvf vf gur shapgvbany pber.
3. `Yvzvgre`: n pbasvt, n zhgrk naq bar ohpxrg. Rirel zrgubq ybpxf, ernqf gur pybpx, naq
   qryrtngrf gb gur ohpxrg.
4. `Xrlrq`: n pbasvt, gur vqyr gvzr, n zhgrk naq n znc bs ohpxrgf jvgu gurve ynfg-hfr gvzr.

Gur zngu rkvfgf bapr. Yvzvgre naq Xrlrq qvssre bayl va jurer gur ohpxrg yvirf naq jung cebgrpgf
vg.

## pbasvt naq inyvqngvba

```tb
vs !(engr >= 0) || zngu.VfVas(engr, 1) {
	cnavp(szg.Fcevags("engryvzvg: engr zhfg or n svavgr ahzore >= 0, tbg %i", engr))
}
```

`engr < 0` vf snyfr sbe AnA (rirel pbzcnevfba jvgu AnA vf snyfr), fb gur pbaqvgvba vf jevggra nf
"abg inyvq". +Vas vf erwrpgrq gbb: "ab yvzvg" vf orggre rkcerffrq ol abg vafgnyyvat n yvzvgre,
naq `Vas × 0 = AnA` vf bar pneryrff yvar njnl sebz n pbhag gung vf AnA sberire naq qravrf rirel
erdhrfg. Gur pbafgehpgbef cnavp, yvxr `gvzr.ArjGvpxre(0)`, orpnhfr n onq yvzvg vf n fgneghc oht;
gur zrffntr anzrf gur svryq naq gur inyhr, orpnhfr vg raqf hc va n penfu ybt.

`ohefg` vf fgberq nf n sybng64: rirel pbzcnevfba naq rirel `zva` vf jvgu gur sybng pbhag, fb bar
pbairefvba ercynprf n qbmra.

## ohpxrg

```tb
shap (o *ohpxrg) gbxrafNg(abj gvzr.Gvzr, p pbasvt) sybng64 {
	ryncfrq := abj.Fho(o.ynfg)
	vs ryncfrq <= 0 {
		erghea o.gbxraf
	}
	erghea zva(p.ohefg, o.gbxraf+p.engr*ryncfrq.Frpbaqf())
}

shap (o *ohpxrg) nqinapr(abj gvzr.Gvzr, p pbasvt) {
	o.gbxraf = o.gbxrafNg(abj, p)
	o.ynfg = abj
}
```

Gjb shapgvbaf, orpnhfr gurer ner gjb arrqf: Fjrrc zhfg xabj gur pbhag ng abj *jvgubhg* punatvat
gur ohpxrg, naq rirel bgure zrgubq zhfg fgber vg. `gbxrafNg` vf cher naq rnfl gb purpx ntnvafg gur
ERNQZR'f sbezhyn ol rlr.

Gur `ryncfrq <= 0` oenapu vf gur onpxjneqf-pybpx ehyr, naq vg nyfb xrrcf `engr × 0` bhg bs gur
nevguzrgvp. `nqinapr` fgberf `abj` hapbaqvgvbanyyl, nyfb jura vg vf rneyvre guna `ynfg`. Gung
fvatyr yvar qrpvqrf jung unccraf nsgre n onpxjneqf whzc: gur ersvyy pbagvahrf sebz gur arj gvzr,
naq gur jbefg pnfr vf bar rkgen ohefg vs gur pybpx yngre whzcf sbejneq ntnva. Jevgvat
`vs abj.Nsgre(o.ynfg) { o.ynfg = abj }` vafgrnq ybbxf zber pnershy naq oybpxf rirel pyvrag sbe nf
ybat nf gur whzc. Gur grfg "ersvyy pbagvahrf sebz gur rneyvre gvzr" rkvfgf sbe rknpgyl guvf yvar.

`abj.Fho` fnghengrf ng gur ynetrfg Qhengvba vafgrnq bs biresybjvat, naq `zva` pncf jungrire gur
cebqhpg vf, fb gurer vf ab biresybj cngu.

`gnxr` fhogenpgf bayl vs gurer vf rabhtu: gur nyy-be-abguvat ehyr va sbhe yvarf.

## Yvzvgre

```tb
glcr Yvzvgre fgehpg {
	pst pbasvt

	zh flap.Zhgrk
	o  ohpxrg
}
```

Gur zhgrk fvgf qverpgyl nobir gur svryqf vg cebgrpgf, n pbzzba Tb pbairagvba gung gryyf n
erivrjre jung gur ybpx pbiref. `pst` vf nobir vg: vg arire punatrf nsgre Arj, fb ernqvat vg arrqf
ab ybpx.

Arj fgberf n shyy pbhag naq `pst.abj()` nf `ynfg`.

Rirel rkcbegrq zrgubq sbyybjf gur fnzr funcr:

```tb
y.zh.Ybpx()
qrsre y.zh.Haybpx()
y.o.nqinapr(y.pst.abj(), y.pst)
// qrpvqr naq punatr
```

Gur pybpx vf ernq haqre gur ybpx, fb gur gvzrf ner nccyvrq va gur beqre gurl jrer ernq. `Nyybj`
vf `NyybjA(1)` naq qbrf abg ybpx vgfrys; bayl bar shapgvba va rnpu pnyy punva ybpxf, fb gur
aba-erragenag zhgrk arire zrrgf vgfrys.

`Gbxraf` fgberf gur ersvyy gbb. Vg pbhyq hfr `gbxrafNg` naq punatr abguvat; fgbevat xrrcf rirel
zrgubq gur fnzr funcr, juvpu vf rnfvre gb erivrj guna bar rkprcgvba, naq zrnaf gung nsgre n
onpxjneqf whzc nal pnyy, n ernq vapyhqrq, znxrf gur arj gvzr gur ersrerapr.

### Erfreir

```tb
arrq := sybng64(a)
vs arrq > y.pst.ohefg {
	erghea 0, szg.Reebes("%j: a = %q, ohefg = %i", ReeRkprrqfOhefg, a, y.pst.ohefg)
}
```

Guvf purpx hfrf bayl gur vzzhgnoyr pbasvt, fb vg ehaf orsber gur ybpx. Gura, haqre gur ybpx:
`yrsg := gbxraf − arrq`. Vs yrsg vf abg artngvir, fgber vg naq erghea 0. Jvgu engr 0, n artngvir
yrsg pna arire or cnvq onpx, fb vg vf na reebe naq abguvat vf fgberq. Bgurejvfr fgber gur qrog naq
pbaireg `−yrsg / engr` frpbaqf gb n jnvg.

Obgu reebef jenc gur fragvary jvgu `%j` naq nqq gur ahzoref: pnyyref oenapu jvgu `reebef.Vf`, naq
gur ybt yvar fnlf jung jnf nfxrq sbe. (`a > ohefg` jvgu engr 0 ercbegf `ReeRkprrqfOhefg`, gur
zber shaqnzragny ceboyrz; gur grfgf qb abg purpx gung pbzovangvba.)

```tb
shap frpbaqfGbQhengvba(f sybng64) gvzr.Qhengvba {
	af := zngu.Prvy(f * sybng64(gvzr.Frpbaq))
	vs af >= zngu.ZnkVag64 {
		erghea zngu.ZnkVag64
	}
	erghea gvzr.Qhengvba(af)
}
```

Zhygvcyl svefg, gura pbaireg: gur 07-ergel yrffba. `Prvy` ebhaqf hc, fb n pnyyre gung fyrrcf gur
erghearq jnvg arire npgf orsber vgf gbxraf rkvfg; gehapngvba jbhyq or 1 af rneyl, juvpu gur grfgf'
1 µf gbyrenapr nyybjf. Gur pynzc pbiref nofheq engrf fhpu nf 1r-12 gbxraf cre frpbaq, jurer gur
jnvg qbrf abg svg va na vag64 naq gur pbairefvba jbhyq or vzcyrzragngvba-qrsvarq.

### Pnapry

Ersvyy, nqq a, pnc ng ohefg. `k/gvzr/engr`'f `Erfreingvba.Pnapry` vf zber cerpvfr: vg ergheaf bayl
gur gbxraf gung ab yngre erfreingvba jnf pbzchgrq ntnvafg. Sbe gung, n erfreingvba zhfg erzrzore
jura vg jnf znqr, juvpu vf bar ernfba `k/gvzr/engr` ergheaf n `*Erfreingvba` naq abg n Qhengvba.

## Xrlrq

```tb
glcr Xrlrq fgehpg {
	pst  pbasvt
	vqyr gvzr.Qhengvba

	zh      flap.Zhgrk
	pyvragf znc[fgevat]*pyvrag
}

glcr pyvrag fgehpg {
	ohpxrg
	ynfgHfrq gvzr.Gvzr
}
```

`pyvrag` rzorqf `ohpxrg`, fb `p.nqinapr(...)` naq `p.gbxraf` jbex qverpgyl. `ynfgHfrq` vf n
frcnengr svryq sebz `ohpxrg.ynfg` ba checbfr. Gur gjb gvzrf nafjre qvssrerag dhrfgvbaf, naq vs
Fjrrc erserfurq gur bar vg nyfb hfrf sbe vqyrarff, ab ohpxrg jbhyq rire or vqyr.

**Cbvagref va gur znc** yrg Nyybj punatr gur ohpxrg va cynpr. N `znc[fgevat]pyvrag` arrqf n
jevgr-onpx (`x.pyvragf[xrl] = p`) nsgre rirel punatr, naq sbetrggvat vg fvyragyl punatrf n pbcl.
Inyhrf fnir na nyybpngvba cre xrl, juvpu pna znggre ng n zvyyvba xrlf.

**Bar zhgrk sbe rirelguvat** vf fvzcyr naq pbeerpg: Nyybj'f jbex vf fubeg. Gur pbfg vf pbagragvba.
N cre-ohpxrg zhgrk cyhf n znc ybpx vf n pbzzba arkg fgrc, jvgu n genc: Fjrrc pna qryrgr n ohpxrg
orgjrra Nyybj'f ybbxhc naq vgf gnxr. Gur gbxra gura pbzrf sebz n ohpxrg ab ybatre va gur znc, naq
gur pyvrag'f arkg erdhrfg trgf n arj, shyy bar. Frg `ynfgHfrq` haqre gur znc ybpx, va gur fnzr
pevgvpny frpgvba nf gur ybbxhc, naq Fjrrc arire frrf n ohpxrg gung Nyybj vf nobhg gb hfr nf vqyr
(sbe vqyr > 0). `GrfgXrlrqPbapheerag` pngpurf gur tnc bayl abj naq gura: vg vf irel aneebj. Funeqvat
(orybj) xrrcf gur bar-ybpx fvzcyvpvgl naq qvivqrf gur pbagragvba.

### Nyybj

Ybpx, ernq gur pybpx, ybbx hc, vafreg n shyy ohpxrg vs gur xrl vf zvffvat, frg `ynfgHfrq`,
nqinapr, gnxr. Gur ybbxhc naq gur vafreg ner va gur fnzr pevgvpny frpgvba, juvpu vf jung znxrf
32 fvzhygnarbhf svefg pnyyf cebqhpr rknpgyl bar ohpxrg. `ynfgHfrq` vf frg orsber gur qrpvfvba, fb
n qravrq pnyy pbhagf nf n hfr: gur pyvrag gung xrrcf trggvat 429f vf gur zbfg npgvir pyvrag
gurer vf.

### Fjrrc

```tb
sbe xrl, p := enatr x.pyvragf {
	vs abj.Fho(p.ynfgHfrq) >= x.vqyr && p.gbxrafNg(abj, x.pst) >= x.pst.ohefg {
		qryrgr(x.pyvragf, xrl)
		erzbirq++
	}
}
```

Gur vqyr purpx pbzrf svefg: vg vf purncre, naq zbfg ragevrf bs n ohfl znc snvy vg. `gbxrafNg`
yrnirf n xrcg ohpxrg hagbhpurq. Qryrgvat qhevat `enatr` vf qrsvarq ol gur fcrp. Pbzcnevat jvgu
ohefg jbexf orpnhfr `zva` ergheaf rknpgyl `ohefg` bapr gur ohpxrg vf shyy.

## Pbzcyrkvgl

Nyybj, NyybjA, Gbxraf, Erfreir naq Pnapry ner B(1): n srj sybng bcrengvbaf, bar znc ybbxhc sbe
Xrlrq. Fjrrc vf B(ahzore bs xrlf) jvgu gur ybpx uryq. Zrzbel vf bar znc ragel cre xrl: gur
fgevat xrl, n cbvagre, naq n `pyvrag` bs nobhg 64 olgrf (n sybng64, gjb `gvzr.Gvzr` inyhrf naq
cnqqvat).

## Jung n erivrjre jbhyq nfx

- **Jul vf gur ybpx uryq qhevat Fjrrc?** Gur znc pnaabg or vgrengrq juvyr bguref jevgr gb vg.
  Jvgu n zvyyvba xrlf, fjrrc n obhaqrq ahzore bs ragevrf cre pnyy, be funeq.
- **Jung unccraf jvgu a < 1?** Gur ERNQZR yrnirf vg bcra, naq guvf fbyhgvba qbrf abg purpx:
  `NyybjA(0)` ergheaf gehr naq `NyybjA(-1)` nqqf n gbxra. Cebqhpgvba pbqr fubhyq erwrpg vg,
  jvgu n cnavp (n pnyyre oht) be ol ergheavat snyfr. `k/gvzr/engr` nyybjf a == 0 hayrff
  erfreingvbaf unir chg gur yvzvgre va qrog.
- **Pna gur znc fuevax?** Ab: Tb zncf xrrc gurve fgbentr nsgre qryrgrf. Nsgre n Fjrrc gung
  erzbirq zbfg xrlf, pbclvat gur fheivibef vagb n serfu znc tvirf gur zrzbel onpx.
- **Jul abg `flap.Znc`?** Vg vf ohvyg sbe xrlf jevggra bapr naq ernq bsgra, be sbe tbebhgvarf ba
  qvfwbvag xrlf. Rirel pnyy urer jevgrf gur ohpxrg, fb lbh arrq n ybpx cre ohpxrg ntnva, naq gur
  Fjrrc genc nobir pbzrf onpx.
- **Vf ernqvat gur pybpx haqre gur ybpx n ceboyrz?** Abg sbe n pybpx. Vg jbhyq or sbe n pnyyonpx
  gung pna oybpx be pnyy onpx vagb gur yvzvgre; 14-pvephvgoernxre qrnyf jvgu gung.

## Gbjneq gur fgergpu tbnyf

- **`Jnvg(pgk, a)`:** `Erfreir(a)`; vs gur jnvg vf 0, erghea. Bgurejvfr `fryrpg` ba n
  `gvzr.ArjGvzre(jnvg)` naq `pgk.Qbar()`; vs pgk jvaf, `Pnapry(a)` naq erghea `pgk.Ree()`. Purpx
  `pgk.Qrnqyvar()` svefg: vs gur jnvg raqf nsgre vg, pnapry ng bapr vafgrnq bs fyrrcvat hagvy gur
  qrnqyvar gb snvy naljnl (`k/gvzr/engr` fnlf "jbhyq rkprrq pbagrkg qrnqyvar").
- **`Ergel-Nsgre`:** n Xrlrq zrgubq gung ergheaf `(1 − gbxraf) / engr` frpbaqf sbe gur xrl, nsgre
  gur ersvyy, ebhaqrq hc gb jubyr frpbaqf sbe gur urnqre. Qb vg va gur fnzr pevgvpny frpgvba nf
  gur Nyybj, be gur gjb nafjref pna qvfnterr.
- **Funeqvat:**

  ```tb
  glcr Funeqrq fgehpg {
  	frrq   zncunfu.Frrq // zncunfu.ZnxrFrrq() bapr, va gur pbafgehpgbe
  	funeqf [16]*Xrlrq
  }

  shap (f *Funeqrq) Nyybj(xrl fgevat) obby {
  	erghea f.funeqf[zncunfu.Fgevat(f.frrq, xrl)%16].Nyybj(xrl)
  }
  ```

  Yra naq Fjrrc fhz bire gur funeqf. N orapuznex jvgu `o.EhaCnenyyry` ng `-pch 1,4,8` fubjf gur
  fvatyr zhgrk synggravat juvyr gur funeqrq irefvba fpnyrf.
- **Onpxtebhaq fjrrcvat:** `EhaFjrrcre(pgk, x, rirel)` vf gur gvpxre ybbc sebz gur rkcynangvba. N
  uneq pnc ba gur ahzore bs xrlf arrqf na rivpgvba beqre: na YEH yvfg arkg gb gur znc, nf va
  09-pnpur, juvpu vf jung atvak qbrf jura vgf mbar vf shyy.
